        "TileImage": "$($repository 1919fa67-81d1-44c1-84a7-722218e0afa8).Image",
        "Description": "Agent Grant 47, intelligence has identified a covert ring known as the “What the Helly” dealers operating under the cover of the Sapporo Snow Festival. \rThey are distributing a neurolinguistic agent disguised as novelty goods, causing subtle speech distortion in the public.\r\rFedorov, a foreign linguistics consultant once embedded in regional research circles, leveraged his outsider status to move unnoticed between groups. \r\rRecruited for his expertise, he now bridges the network’s global reach.",
